{"date":"2025-09-14","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_286bcd9233780dbca1aea447c8ac7035","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1757842200,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-09-11","chunk":0,"id":"m_4003053448d97f021cba12df88ed3fa7"}}},{"id":"m_af794ee3dbad7a43aa19c00d534be9b2","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1757842237,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fe228b10dea8ba069f26b7265df5abf4","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1757842274,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8889c2aca9dac89d0aeac44cf1d1efa3","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1757842311,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_56fba3d2f1e233c4bafb6b0e2e540e7a","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1757842348,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_15e0c57b9cb1b09ca69e51ece0be00a8","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1757842385,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5345e48265cdae0740052e0a884d2621","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1757842422,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_c7883fa274e4098ca6fd9723b73b6a23","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1757842459,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_da4ff500d35b30a5ca78896fe8c47d06","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1757842496,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8f798cad81eb01ee11d42a473d2e36db","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1757842533,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_de9722144072dbbb6af90ecab23b8a07","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1757842570,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_62550df955207a4ea9de2a1525ca932c","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1757842607,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4a4369d19c74fd51520800acc84cec4e","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1757842644,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_482783a8980fc71d6db443a9bec7e276","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1757842681,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0c05e236cef35743a6de8140e94167f7","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1757842718,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b0145caca0f73fcc040fd48e60fda99e","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1757842755,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_72f461e35bf74db3b445e774fe085b45","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1757842792,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1cad5eef9f1d1405cefb4ef563258198","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1757842829,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e621a649d0a6e6db1574335b9846c092","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1757842866,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e4464a6c0b0d21f35d31311f9ef92484","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1757842903,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6619c8e3d81ec90706ee86c6c4a728d5","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1757842940,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2fbc60e7e1e78816d4a5083edb679a72","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1757842977,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_bbb08ed2cdc0e51116b761748166fe80","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1757843014,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_98492accd3250d55711bd0e326ac38cb","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1757843051,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
